## Announcements

## Dr. Neil Voss

## October 27, 2026

=== layout: one-panel

# Today's agenda

@body

- Ice breaker and announcements
- Linked genes and recombination
- Genetic mapping
- Three-point testcross examples
- Chi-square tests for linkage
- Gene distances group activity
- Closing remarks

=== layout: one-panel

# [Breakout Room Chat]{color=red}

@body

- State your name, major, and plans after graduation.
- [You can genetically modify one animal. What would you change?]{color=red}
- Choose a farm animal, pet, or wild species.
- Explain the useful trait and one possible tradeoff.
- If no one is talking, please be the first to speak.

