# *Ways to Contact Dr. Voss*

@body

- [Office hours]{color=green}\: Ask questions in person or over Zoom.
- [Discord]{color=red}\: The quickest way to reach me.
  - I check several times per day.
  - Send a direct message for private questions or post general questions to the class.
  - Response time\: 1-2 calendar days.
- [Email]{color=blue}.
  - Response time\: 2 business days.
- [Anonymous Google Form]{color=purple}.
  - Response time\: 2-4 business days.

